  "final_text": "New chat\nImages\nPlugins\nDeep research\nSee plans and pricing\nHelp\nSettings\nGet responses tailored to you\n\nLog in to get answers based on saved chats, plus create images and upload files.\n\nLog in\nChatGPT\nLog in\nSign up for free\nYou said:\n\nhii\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nHii! \ud83d\udc4b\ud83d\ude0a How are you doing? What can I help you with today?\n\nYou said:\n\nhwllo my name is reo\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nHello, Reo! \ud83d\ude04\ud83d\udc4b Nice to meet you! What are you up to today?\n\nYou said:\n\nwhats your name\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nI\u2019m ChatGPT \ud83d\ude0a You can call me GPT if you like!\n\nNice to meet you, Reo! \ud83d\udc4b\u2728\n\nYou said:\n\nsuper tell mee the 20 best tamil movies\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nAbsolutely, Reo! \ud83d\ude0e\ud83d\udd25 If you want a 20-best Tamil movies list, I\u2019d mix classics, modern masterpieces, action, comedy, romance, and thrillers.\n\nNayakan \u2014 \u2b50 A legendary gangster drama.\n\nAnbe Sivam \u2014 \u2764\ufe0f Beautiful, philosophical, and emotional.\n\nPariyerum Perumal \u2014 Powerful social drama.\n\nThevar Magan \u2014 Family, power, and rural politics.\n\nVikram Vedha \u2014 \ud83e\udde0 One of the best cat-and-mouse thrillers.\n\nKaithi \u2014 \ud83d\udd25 Non-stop action.\n\nJai Bhim \u2014 Hard-hitting courtroom drama.\n\nSuper Deluxe \u2014 Weird, bold, and brilliantly made.\n\n96 \u2014 \ud83d\udc95 Nostalgic and emotional.\n\nRatsasan \u2014 \ud83d\ude31 Excellent serial-killer thriller.\n\nAruvi \u2014 Unique and deeply moving.\n\nSoorarai Pottru \u2014 \u2708\ufe0f Inspirational and energetic.\n\nVada Chennai \u2014 Gritty North Chennai gangster saga.\n\nParuthiveeran \u2014 Raw, intense rural romance.\n\nMahanadhi \u2014 \ud83d\ude22 One of Kamal Haasan's most powerful films.\n\nPudhupettai \u2014 Dark and unforgettable.\n\nAayirathil Oruvan \u2014 \u2694\ufe0f Ambitious and way ahead of its time.\n\nKaaka Muttai \u2014 Simple, funny, and touching.\n\nRaja Rani \u2014 \ud83d\udc95 Great romantic entertainer.\n\nSoodhu Kavvum \u2014 \ud83d\ude02 Crazy, clever, and hilarious.\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 My personal Top 5\n\n1. Nayakan\n2. Anbe Sivam\n3. Vikram Vedha\n4. Vada Chennai\n5. Pariyerum Perumal\n\nIf you tell me your favourite genre\u2014mass \ud83d\udd25, comedy \ud83d\ude02, romance \u2764\ufe0f, thriller \ud83d\ude31, or emotional \ud83d\ude2d\u2014I can give you a Top 20 specifically for that genre.\n\nChatGPT is AI and can make mistakes.\n\nChat with ChatGPT",
